  "description": "A high-performance Razor Class Library for Umbraco 17 (.NET 10) that displays Instagram feeds using \n    the official Instagram Graph API (v21.0). Features automatic dictionary item creation (Instagram.AccessToken,Instagram.UserId, \n    and Instagram.Limit), an embedded responsive Razor partial view with standalone CSS (no Bootstrap dependency), configurable \n    post limits, strongly typed models, dependency injection, and zero-configuration installation for Umbraco websites.",
